# ─── Sonarr VPN egress (Gluetun → ExpressVPN, custom OpenVPN) ────────────────
# Sonarr's outbound traffic egresses through this tunnel so the apps VM's
# residential IP isn't exposed. See the compose file header for the full
# rationale and the .ovpn hostname→IP gotcha. Injected into Gluetun via env_file.
#
# These are NOT your normal ExpressVPN login. Get them from:
#   expressvpn.com → Advanced Setup → Manual Configuration → OpenVPN
# That page shows a dedicated OpenVPN username + password — paste them here, and
# download a server .ovpn from the same page to services/arr/expressvpn.ovpn
# (gitignored). The same credential pair works for both this and Dispatcharr;
# ExpressVPN permits multiple simultaneous connections.
OPENVPN_USER=
OPENVPN_PASSWORD=
